<title>THAILAND: Hana sets 3.30 baht 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Hana sets 3.30 baht 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  3.30    vs     3.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 3, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	N/A</p>
<p>Note: Hana Microelectronics Plc is a manufacturer of electronic parts.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
